---
title: "SSD: Claim Posted Shift (UC-05)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant System as :System
    Employee->>System: viewSwapBoard()
    System-->>Employee: posted shifts, each with its rule check
    Employee->>System: claimShift(swapId)
    alt the claimer passes every blocking rule
        System-->>Employee: claimed, waiting on the manager
    else a blocking rule fails
        System-->>Employee: refused, names the rule and the numbers
    end
